{"id":"perf_568ae2e4556418e5","title":"“皇帝”与“英雄”——苏州交响乐团音乐会","city":"苏州","venue":"苏州文化艺术中心","hall":"金鸡湖音乐厅","startTime":"2027-01-08T11:30:00.000Z","weekday":"周五","dateLabel":"01/08","timeLabel":"19:30","description":"本场音乐会由指挥家俞潞执棒，钢琴家元杰担任独奏，聚焦贝多芬两部同为降E大调的传世巨作。降E大调第五钢琴协奏曲“皇帝”以恢宏气度与辉煌音响，展现独奏与乐队之间交相辉映、浑然一体的艺术境界，成就古典协奏曲的巅峰典范；降E大调第三交响曲“英雄”则以空前宏阔的结构、深邃的人文精神与澎湃的戏剧张力，开启浪漫主义交响传统的新纪元。从协奏曲的璀璨对话到交响曲的壮阔史诗，两部诞生于同一调性的经典作品相映生辉，充分彰显贝多芬革新传统的非凡创造力与震撼人心的精神力量。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238895073","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088091367383056384.html","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z","ensemble":"苏州交响乐团","conductor":"俞潞","performers":["俞潞","元杰"],"composers":["贝多芬"],"program":[{"composer":"贝多芬","title":"降E大调第五钢琴协奏曲","opus":"Op. 73","confidence":"official","id":"program_76306d93d0c5d535","workId":"work_fef06d7e2dc3593e"},{"composer":"贝多芬","title":"降E大调第三交响曲","opus":"Op. 55","confidence":"official","id":"program_c734745d0604659b","workId":"work_2dedf164b0d51654"}],"tags":["贝多芬","交响","音乐会"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_a1cded5bc4ef9daa","priceTiers":[],"sources":[{"sourceId":"suzhou-symphony-official","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"szsorch_2088091367383056384_1799407800000","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088091367383056384.html","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238895073","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z"}]}